 <li>Light Blue (Pantone 2121), resembling the current <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-17/">iPhone 17</a>'s Mist Blue</li><br/>
 <li>Dark Cherry (Pantone 6076), the headline new color</li><br/>
 <li>Dark Gray (Pantone 426C)</li><br/>
 <li>Silver (Pantone 427C), similar to the current generation</li><br/>
